cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use this software, please cite it using the metadata below."
type: software
title: Bovnar
abbreviation: BVNR
abstract: >-
  A text-based serialization format in which every value carries its own type
  family, bit width, numeric base and physical unit inline, with no external
  schema, so that dimensional mismatches are rejected by the parser rather than
  by a separate validation pass. Ships a dependency-free C99 reference
  implementation with a streaming reader, DOM API, writer, command-line tool,
  WebAssembly build and pure-ctypes Python bindings.
authors:
